refactor(test): robustify test-example target

The exampleCanRenderTest was a bit misnamed and could lead to strange results
since it waited for the LAYERS_INITIALIZED event, which is only fired when
layers are added...

Also all tests duplicated the same boilerplate code:

    page.setViewport({ width: 400, height: 300 });
    await page.goto(`http://localhost:${itownsPort}/examples/3dtiles.html`);
    await page.waitFor('#viewerDiv > canvas');
    const result = await exampleCanRenderTest(page, this.test.fullTitle());

Two new functions have been added, and exampleCanRenderTest has been removed:
    loadExample: is equivalent to the above code
    waitUntilItownsIsIdle: is to be used when something has been changed in the
view and we want to wait until itowns has finished working.

