feat (3dtiles): improve gltf line support

Map all gltf line modes to the proper THREE.Line* class.

From three's documentation:
    THREE.Line is using gl.LINE_STRIP
    THREE.LineSegments [...] is rendered using gl.LINES
    THREE.LineLoop [...] is rendered using gl.LINE_LOOP

And from GLTF spec:
    {
        "enum": [ 1 ],
        "description": "LINES"
    },
    {
        "enum": [ 2 ],
        "description": "LINE_LOOP"
    },
    {
        "enum": [ 3 ],
        "description": "LINE_STRIP"
    },
https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF/blob/master/specification/2.0/schema/mesh.primitive.schema.json#L28

